msgid "Relative comparison within the original project and source language: low below the 50% rank, elevated from 50%, high from 80%. Equal values share a rank; fewer than five measurements or a constant nonzero population are neutral. Zero and one connected LCOM4 group are low. NOC is informational. Colors guide review; they do not prove class quality."
